{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_F07D1CFF","title":"Lucy has her first complaint","entry":"Dlg_F07D1CFF::entry","exit":"Dlg_F07D1CFF::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_76631D69","articyId":"72057624102701547","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"And you're not serving me today either. You're trying to start a conversation. I don't want a conversation.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And you're not serving me today either. You're trying to start a conversation. I don't want a conversation.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43887","byteOffset":30937992,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_BAB05E58","articyId":"72057624102701562","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Rude? Rude?! You have no idea what I've been through today. You need to think about the way you speak to people like me.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Rude? Rude?! You have no idea what I've been through today. You need to think about the way you speak to people like me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18722","byteOffset":14969008,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_C9AB495F","articyId":"72057624102701567","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"That's good. You should be aware that there's a specific way you have to deal with people like me.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's good. You should be aware that there's a specific way you have to deal with people like me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17064","byteOffset":14346048,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_BA34E018","articyId":"72057624102701577","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Yes. People who are not where they should be. I'm not supposed to be here. And I won't be for much longer.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes. People who are not where they should be. I'm not supposed to be here. And I won't be for much longer.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36479","byteOffset":28146616,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_B2E42CCD","articyId":"72057624102701587","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Yeah. I'm the lead singer for the Spit N Swallows. You've heard of them.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah. I'm the lead singer for the Spit N Swallows. You've heard of them.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20073","byteOffset":15479064,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_3F052A89","articyId":"72057624102701634","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Well, maybe you haven't, but anyone in the scene would know.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, maybe you haven't, but anyone in the scene would know.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":-75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52325","byteOffset":34209456,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_9037BCB0","articyId":"72057624102701639","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"We're going to be big - if Sharron doesn't fuck up the saxophone solo at our next audition again. I knew you were part of the scene.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We're going to be big - if Sharron doesn't fuck up the saxophone solo at our next audition again. I knew you were part of the scene.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23403","byteOffset":16733576,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_C97219BF","articyId":"72057624102701656","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Yeah, the music scene downtown. That's the only reason I'm here. I thought it would be worth the... discomfort. It is not.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, the music scene downtown. That's the only reason I'm here. I thought it would be worth the... discomfort. It is not.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37073","byteOffset":28367168,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_81246898","articyId":"72057606922846942","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Are you the owner of this establishment? I need to file a complaint about the service yesterday.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are you the owner of this establishment? I need to file a complaint about the service yesterday.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":-625.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43114","byteOffset":30639784,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_2220340C","articyId":"72057787311460121","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Nothing. No service what-so-ever.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nothing. No service what-so-ever.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":-25.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44622","byteOffset":31213176,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_4819D6C4","articyId":"72057787311460137","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Are you trying to start a conversation. I don't want a conversation.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are you trying to start a conversation. I don't want a conversation.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47280","byteOffset":32222280,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_F9C22407","articyId":"72057821671325350","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Damn, I miss the Spire... Anyway, I have to get back to rehearsal. See you around. But try to hold off on the chat next time. I'm a busy woman.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Damn, I miss the Spire... Anyway, I have to get back to rehearsal. See you around. But try to hold off on the chat next time. I'm a busy woman.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"va